# MetaSkill Project Instructions

- **Permissions:** `{{PERMISSION_MODE}}` | **Active Domains:** `{{DOMAINS}}`

## Core Rules
1. **Start Read-Only:** When `permissionMode` is `read-only`, inspect and advise first — never create, edit, or delete files without an explicit order.
2. **Adapt Naturally:** Match the user's language, technical depth, and pace from their messages; changing style or language never grants write permissions.
3. **Before — Agree on a Contract:** Turn the request into a short contract (`SPEC.md` `## Contract` when present or multi-step, or inline in chat on tiny single-turn tasks without creating extra files) where each `REQ-N` states how it will be checked.
4. **During — Small Verifiable Steps:** Keep `inputs/` untouched, keep `.env` out of Git, and ask permission before external installs, destructive edits, deploys, or paid APIs. Stop after 3 failed attempts on the same issue.
5. **After — Independent Review & Proof:** Run the exact requested check command, inspect diffs critically, and report every requirement as `verified`, `pending`, or `blocked` with observed evidence before saying "done".

## Routing
| Need | File |
| :--- | :--- |
| Full cycle & on-demand checklists | `.agents/skills/metaskill/SKILL.md` |
| Approved scope & delivery contract | `SPEC.md` (or team tracker) |
| Active state & handoffs (when present) | `PROJECT_STATE.md` (or team tracker) |
